# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim).
# Played by audio/jingles.js: game/flow.js settleIn, the first time at the first depth of act II in a world.
title    Act II: Growing up
composer Claude
about    The happiest stretch: the toy tune varied, turned around (E D C, A B, C), on crystal with a glass harmonica a third below it, two voices together, over F, G and A minor, a vibraphone, and the bird's wide call.
tempo    84
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.5

# mood explore: lead glow bird vibes harm bass

voice lead     crystal    vol=0.75 pan=-0.15
voice glow     glassharp  vol=0.3  pan=0.25 att=0.06 rel=0.4
voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.4  rev=0.75
voice vibes    vibes      vol=0.34 pan=0.3
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.2  pan=-0.2 center=A4 att=0.2 rel=1
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.6

# F G Am: the tune turned around, two voices in thirds
pattern varied
lead    | E5--- D5- C5----- | A4----- B4----- | C5----------- |
glow    | C5--- B4- A4----- | F4----- G4----- | A4----------- |
vibes   | F3- C4- A4- C4- F4- C4- | G3- D4- B4- D4- G4- D4- | A3- E4- C5- E4- A4- E4- |
harm    | [F]?----------- | [G]?----------- | [Am]----------- |
bass    | A1----------- | B1----------- | C2----------- |
bird    | _ | _ | .----- A6 A5+B5---- |

loop varied
